VALUES ('NET-066', 'Routing loop - Scenario 1', 'Packets circulate between routers instead of reaching the destination.', 'Typical Cisco Packet Tracer topology involving a routing-related fault. The exact devices and addressing should be inferred only from the provided case evidence.', 'traceroute. Use the returned configuration/status as the primary evidence. Also compare the affected device/interface with the neighboring device and the expected topology. Do not assume the fault without matching evidence.', 'Routing loop. Inspect routes on each hop.', 'Layer 3', 'Routing', 'Low', 'traceroute', '1) Correct incorrect routes or routing protocol configuration. 2) Verify the configuration with traceroute. 3) Test the affected communication path. 4) Confirm that no unrelated configuration was changed.', 1)
