VALUES ('NET-254', 'Subnet mask mismatch - Scenario 4', 'Interface mask causes incorrect local/remote network interpretation. Variant 4: the failure occurs in a slightly different topology or addressing scenario and should be confirmed against the supplied evidence.', 'Typical Cisco Packet Tracer topology involving a interface-related fault. The exact devices and addressing should be inferred only from the provided case evidence.', 'show ip interface. Use the returned configuration/status as the primary evidence. Also compare the affected device/interface with the neighboring device and the expected topology. Do not assume the fault without matching evidence.', 'Subnet mask mismatch. Compare masks across the topology.', 'Layer 3', 'Interface', 'High', 'show ip interface', '1) Configure the correct subnet mask. 2) Verify the configuration with show ip interface. 3) Test the affected communication path. 4) Confirm that no unrelated configuration was changed.', 1)
